<title>AUSTRIA: VA Stahl details 1996 results.</title>
<headline>VA Stahl details 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						1996	   1995</p>
<p> Group sales			     31,519	33,796</p>
<p> Group operating before		 3,551   vs  4,825</p>
<p>depreciation</p>
<p> Group earnings before interest     1,695   vs  3,044</p>
<p>and tax (EBIT)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax			    2,031   vs  3,257</p>
<p> Group net				  1,688   vs  3,071</p>
<p> Group workforce			 14,795   vs 15,053</p>
<p> Dividend (schillings)		     12   vs     13</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is VA Stahl AG. It is 38.8 percent owned by Austrian state holding company OeIAG. VA Stahl said in future its financial year will end on March 31. -- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
